<h1>Content rules</h1>
<ol>
<li><b>No malware.</b> Files that harm computers, steal data or do anything hidden lead to a permanent ban.</li>
<li><b>Only upload your own content or content you have permission for.</b> Reuploading other people's mods or unauthorised modpacks is forbidden. If you use trademarked brands, characters or art you are responsible for it; content is removed at the rights holder's request.</li>
<li><b>Be honest.</b> Describe what the mod really does and select the correct versions. No misleading titles or images.</li>
<li><b>Write a proper description</b> explaining what the mod does and how to use it.</li>
<li><b>No bought engagement or fake downloads.</b> Such earnings are voided.</li>
<li><b>Be respectful in comments.</b> Insults, hate speech, spam and personal information are removed.</li>
<li><b>No adult, illegal or violence-glorifying content.</b></li>
</ol>
<p>Projects breaking the rules are rejected or unlisted. Moderators explain their decisions in a note.</p>
